invariant: INV-25
file: x509.c
catches: test/lint-exact-fill.sh
reason: parse_extensions drops the equality that makes the Extensions
  SEQUENCE fill its [3] wrapper and keeps the `while (rb_left(&w) > 0)`
  walk below it. A walk says nothing about whether the fields fill the
  container, so a lint that accepts any mention of rb_left passes this.
  lint-exact-fill requires an equality, so it objects.

--- old
    if (!x509_read_header(&w, 0x30, &list_len) || list_len == 0 || list_len != rb_left(&w)) {
--- new
    if (!x509_read_header(&w, 0x30, &list_len) || list_len == 0) {
